{
  "$comment": "State-surface registry (hds#612, spec hirobius/ops#576). Every file or section that describes project state, and what keeps it true: generated (a generator builds it; its --check runs elsewhere), checked (a named gate compares it with the code), editorial (hand-written; owner, reviewedAt and maxAgeDays; the gate says \"review due\" past maxAgeDays). Read by scripts/check-state-surfaces.mjs. After re-reading an editorial file, bump its reviewedAt. ignoreReferences lists path prefixes that docs name but a clean checkout lacks. alwaysOn lists the files every agent loads first (CLAUDE.md and what it marks read-first); the gate flags derived facts (versions, counts, issue lists, \"as of\" state) in them, and docs/guardrails/steering-budget.json caps their size.",
